2. UPSTREAM DATA — Apache-2.0
-----------------------------

(A) Equational Theories Project — tables.

    Source:   https://github.com/teorth/equational_theories
    Path:     equational_theories/Generated/All4x4Tables/*.lean
    Fetched:  2026-11-10 (no pinned commit in that checkout; the directory is
              regenerated by the project's own tooling)
    Licence:  Apache-2.0
    What we took: the table text inside `finOpTable "[[...]]"` literals. 946 of
              the 1171 files in that directory carry such a literal; we vendored
              only the 31 tables we actually reference.

    Files in this repository derived from it:

      data/tables_referenced.json   31 tables in full, keyed by sha256
      data/witnesses_264.tsv        the same tables in `Table [[...]]` /
                                    `Proves [...]` text form
      lean/Witness_*.lean           31 files in the shape of the project's
                                    `Generated` family; the table literal and
                                    the theorem statement shape are the
                                    project's, the selection and generation
                                    code are ours

    The `Facts` list in each lean/ file is computed by us, not copied: it is the
    set of laws that table satisfies out of the 4694, plus the targets it refutes.

(B) Equational Theories Project — equations.txt and the two graph artifacts.

    Source:   https://github.com/teorth/equational_theories
    Paths:    equational_theories/Equations/equations.txt (4694 laws,
              line number = law number), and the published graph artifacts
              graph.json / finite_graph.json under the project's web assets,
