              and line 74.
    Licence:  Apache-2.0
    In this repository: the law numbers and law texts quoted inside
              data/witnesses_264.json, and the two-site split recorded in
              data/graph_facts.json. The 9 MB graph files are NOT vendored;
              scripts/fetch_etp_data.py downloads and decodes them.

(C) carlok/parsimagma — the target list and the extension parameters.

    Source:   https://github.com/carlok/parsimagma
    Paths:    data/etp/finite_uncovered.txt  (the 264 residual pairs, previous
              revision; 39 on the 1062 side + 225 on the 814 side)
              docs/the-39.md lines 147-162  (the §5.6 affine-extension
              parameters, 16 settings in 8 groups)
    Licence:  Apache-2.0
    In this repository: the 264 pair numbers (data/witnesses_264.json,
              data/updated_finite_uncovered.txt), the 16 extension parameters
              (reports/minimal/ext_settings_16.json), and the discussion of them
